fortigate-vpn-linux-gui (1.5.0-1) noble; urgency=medium

  * Distribution and update-experience release on the frozen v1.4.0 /
    v1.3.0 VPN backends.
  * GitHub Releases update checks from About, with optional once-per-day
    automatic checks. The GUI never downloads or installs packages.
  * About shows helper, Python, Qt/PySide, openfortivpn, and strongSwan
    component versions.
  * GitHub Actions tag workflow builds and attaches the Debian package.
  * APT repository generation and signing path for GitHub Pages
    (signed-by keyring; repository is not live until separately published).
  * Application version 1.5.0. Helper capability version remains 0.9.0;
    JSON-lines protocol_version remains 1.

